    "title": "Wanna - Live Video Chat",
    "description": "Discover the Joy of Video Chat with Wanna\r\nWanna connects you to a world of video chatting with users from around the globe. It's a safe haven where you can express your true self and bridge gaps through video conversations.\r\n\r\nWhy Choose Wanna?\r\n\r\n- Instant Messaging: Send texts and chat with friends you've made through video chat.\r\n- Engaging Conversations: Dive into meaningful and fun video chats.\r\n- Stay Connected: Follow users, get followed, and call them anytime to keep the conversation going.\r\n- Real-Time Translation: Enjoy real-time translations during video chats and instant messaging.\r\nPrivacy and Security: Experience secure and private video chatting.\r\nFind your joy and connections on Wanna.",
